&lt;p&gt;At Juniper, we believe authenticity drives performance. Your success is defined by your ability to find the right voices, build meaningful relationships, and create a content engine that scales our message while maintaining the trust and empathy our category demands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;ll also expect you to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale What&#39;s Working&lt;/strong&gt;: Take the learnings from successful partnerships like Liesel Jones and codify them into a repeatable playbook. Identify what made those partnerships work—authenticity, content quality, audience fit—and replicate it across a broader roster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the Ambassador Strategy &amp;amp; Infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;: Develop the frameworks for identifying, vetting, onboarding, and activating partners who authentically align with our mission to be the most supportive partner in women&#39;s health. Create processes that allow us to manage multiple ambassadors simultaneously without losing quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruit &amp;amp; Manage a Diverse Ambassador Roster&lt;/strong&gt;: Source ambassadors across different platforms, audience sizes, and demographics. Balance macro reach with micro relatability. Build relationships that go beyond one-off posts to create ongoing, authentic partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Multi-Platform Content Creation&lt;/strong&gt;: Brief ambassadors to create content that performs organically on their channels while also being optimised for use in our paid media. Ensure content feels native to each platform—Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, podcasts—while maintaining Juniper&#39;s brand integrity and aspirational positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimise for Dual Use&lt;/strong&gt;: Work closely with the Performance and Creative teams to ensure ambassador content can seamlessly transition from organic posts to high-performing ads. You&#39;ll need to understand what makes content work in both contexts and brief accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure Impact &amp;amp; Scale What Works&lt;/strong&gt;: Track performance across reach, engagement, credibility metrics, and paid media ROI. Use data to refine the ambassador mix and double down on what&#39;s driving real business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
