&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Growth Marketing Manager who thinks about patient acquisition the way a GM thinks about a business. You&#39;ll own Hers&#39; growth marketing strategy — from channel investment and budget allocation through to the customer insights and creative ideas that drive it.&lt;br&gt;This isn&#39;t a campaign execution role. You&#39;ll be setting the strategic direction: understanding who our patients are and why they come to Hers, turning that insight into high-performing creative and messaging, and making smart commercial trade-offs to grow efficiently. You&#39;ll work cross-functionally with creative, clinical, analytics, and product teams across Sydney and the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
