&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Hers&#39; patient acquisition strategy end-to-end — from channel mix and budget allocation through to the messaging hypotheses that drive it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use customer research, patient insight, and performance data to build strategies that attract the right patients at the right cost&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance CAC and LTV trade-offs — understanding the difference between patients who stay engaged in their treatment and those who don&#39;t, and using that to inform acquisition decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a rigorous test-and-learn framework across channels, creative formats, and audience segments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with our creative team to develop concepts grounded in real patient insight — you understand &lt;em&gt;why&lt;/em&gt; creative works, not just whether it does&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify the highest-leverage opportunities across paid channels (Meta, Google, YouTube, TikTok) and funnel experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with analytics, product, and clinical to make sure growth is connected to the full patient experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate a clear, evidence-based point of view on performance and strategy to senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
