&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of creative as a commercial lever — you can brief it, evaluate it, and iterate in partnership with a creative team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial instinct: you understand CAC/LTV dynamics and can make budget investment decisions with confidence&lt;/li&gt;
