&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator and natural cross-functional partner — you influence product, analytics, creative, and clinical without needing direct authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives setting their own agenda in a fast-moving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
