&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role (What you’ll be doing)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role you&#39;ll sit at the intersection of clinical excellence, patient experience, and public advocacy, a truly unique leadership role in digital healthcare.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop a team that delivers world class patient care:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll lead and develop our Sydney-based medical support team. This means setting the bar for clinical standards, the care our team deliver and creating an environment where your team can do their best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Patient-first approach.&lt;/strong&gt; Embed empathy into every decision by deeply understanding patient needs ensuring that every improvement to our patient journey makes patients feel safe, clear, and supported.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clinical &amp;amp; Patient Experience Expert:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll be the ultimate escalation point for complex patient enquiries across our Sydney HQ and offshore support teams. When our patient support teams encounter cases that require senior clinical judgement, they&#39;ll look to you. You&#39;ll work cross-functionally with clinical, operations, and product teams to identify risks, drive process improvements, and ensure we&#39;re delivering safe, high-quality care at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clinical Thought Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Whether you&#39;re speaking at industry events, contributing to articles, or collaborating with our marketing team to create compelling patient-centred content, you&#39;ll help explain the wraparound care model that makes our clinics different. You&#39;ll translate complex clinical concepts into stories that resonate with patients and the broader community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you (Who you are)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a registered nurse (AHPRA) with 4+ years experience in a clinical, patient-facing role or in operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have proven experience leading and managing a clinical/operations team, including performance management and professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re a skilled communicator who can navigate sensitive clinical and non-clinical conversations with empathy, clarity, and confidence - whether with a patient, a team member, or a cross-functional stakeholder&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong clinical judgement and are comfortable being the final escalation point for complex or high-risk cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re a natural problem-solver who looks for systemic improvements, not just case-by-case fixes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re excited about the intersection of technology, healthcare, and patient outcomes AND want to help us shape what best-in-class digital care looks like&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re comfortable speaking in public: contributing to content, speaking at events, and representing EUC&#39;s clinical philosophy externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You embrace change, thrive in ambiguous environment, and are motivated primarily by the positive impact new solutions can have on patients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a previous experience or are curious about telehealth environments and with GLP-1&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with offshore or distributed team operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a media contributor, health writer, or public health communicator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing network in the Australian nursing or digital health community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join Eucalyptus?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is also behind a growing family of digital healthcare clinics (&lt;a href=&quot;https://pilot.com.au/&quot;&gt;Pilot,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.kinfertility.com.au/&quot;&gt;Kin&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://skin.software/&quot;&gt;Software&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.compound.co/&quot;&gt;Compound&lt;/a&gt;) across men’s health and well-being, fertility, skincare, and preventative health.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s what makes joining Euc unique:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s next&lt;/strong&gt; - Our goal for the next three years is to support &lt;strong&gt;1 million patients globally&lt;/strong&gt; to live better for longer. We’re launching into new conditions, demographics, and geographies as we build a truly preventive healthcare ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build something world-changing&lt;/strong&gt; - We’re on the path to becoming the world’s largest international digital healthcare company. It will be challenging, fast-paced, and deeply rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make real impact&lt;/strong&gt; - You will deliver work that directly shapes patient outcomes and scales evidence-based care across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate your growth&lt;/strong&gt; - You will have high ownership, continuous feedback, and dedicated development support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join a motivated team&lt;/strong&gt; - You will collaborate with talented peers to solve complex clinical and operational problems at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What’s ahead in Australia?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow with us globally -&lt;/strong&gt; Get mentorship from leaders across Australia, the UK, Germany, and Japan, collaborate with teams in the Philippines and South Africa, and explore new markets or travel internationally. ****Recognised on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hatch.team/companies/eucalyptus&quot;&gt;Hatch’s Hotlist&lt;/a&gt; as one of Australia’s top employers, we support early-career professionals to become future global leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape your career -&lt;/strong&gt; Access learning budgets, conferences, certifications, peer shadowing, and a global knowledge-sharing culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be an owner -&lt;/strong&gt; Equity for everyone means you share in our success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work where well-being matters -&lt;/strong&gt; Experience catered wellness talks, exercise classes, whoops to track your wellbeing, free barista coffees, funded social clubs, and quarterly rooftop parties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovate with purpose -&lt;/strong&gt; Use state-of-the-art tools and contribute to bold, impactful solutions in healthcare.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support at every stage -&lt;/strong&gt; Benefit from parental and miscarriage leave, to health, professional development, and personal days, Whoop membership, and our Employee Assistance Program.&lt;/li&gt;
