&lt;li&gt;Action patient feedback to deliver a higher quality service to drive higher patient satisfaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate, timely documentation to support continuity of care and quality assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Buddy with new starters as required to mentor on how to coach safely and to a high quality&lt;/li&gt;
