&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the intersection of:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative and creator strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Community building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Campaign operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brand storytelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll support the day-to-day management and optimisation of Juniper’s creator partnerships programme, develop and optimise creative briefs and conceptualise scroll-stopping organic creator campaigns. You’ll be helping us scale a highly nuanced and strategically important channel within a regulated healthcare category.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unlike traditional influencer marketing roles, success at Juniper requires a strong understanding of:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creator-native content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance-led creative and brief writing (particularly optimisation of briefs for whitelisted/paid partnership ads)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audience psychology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Long-term brand building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nuanced healthcare and wellness messaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Creator activity is a core growth lever within the business, not just a PR objective.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Creator Campaign Management&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and conceptualise end-to-end creator campaigns across Paid and Organic Growth&lt;/li&gt;
