&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting patients living with obesity across our 5 markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Received selective NICE endorsement to provide services to the NHS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tailored our offering to thousands of patients in Australia, the UK, Germany, Japan and Canada.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Eucalyptus has recently agreed to be acquired by Hims &amp;amp; Hers, a move that will help accelerate our international expansion and bring our model of personalised, preventative healthcare to even more people globally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring MBA interns to join Eucalyptus as Strategy Associates over the summer, or part-time during term.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a unique opportunity to step inside one of the fastest-growing digital health companies and own high-priority projects with real commercial and strategic impact. You’ll work directly with senior leaders across the business to tackle mission-critical initiatives spanning market expansion, commercial strategy, customer journey improvements, and post-acquisition integration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a shadowing role. It’s a hands-on internship where you’ll be expected to take a project from idea through to execution, and help us build the future of healthcare along the way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead one or more high-impact strategic projects, scoping, validating, and executing alongside senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across cross-functional teams including Growth, Product, and Operations to drive outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve business-critical problems in areas such as operations optimisation with AI, market expansion, partnerships, or patient journey improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop frameworks, insights, or tools that can scale beyond your internship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to our operating rhythm by tracking KPIs, preparing leadership materials, and helping shape strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a strong point of view, challenge assumptions, and help turn ambiguity into action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently enrolled in an MBA program at London Business School or another top-tier institution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4–8 years of experience in consulting, investment banking, strategy, operations, or fast-paced startups&lt;/li&gt;
