&lt;li&gt;Run scheduled treatment reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and maintain patient education materials in Spanish&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the broader clinical team to flag issues, improve protocols, and handle escalations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cover a rotating 7-day window (3-4 hours/day including weekends)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
