&lt;li&gt;You have proven experience leading and managing a clinical/operations team, including performance management and professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re a skilled communicator who can navigate sensitive clinical and non-clinical conversations with empathy, clarity, and confidence - whether with a patient, a team member, or a cross-functional stakeholder&lt;/li&gt;
