&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead clinical input for&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;new product launches and market expansion in Japan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and continuously improve&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Japan-specific models of care&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
