&lt;li&gt;Develop clear&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;protocols&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(e.g., prescribing criteria, eligibility thresholds, escalation processes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support regulatory readiness, audits, and compliance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with external stakeholders to ensure adherence to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;local standards of care&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
