&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3-6 years of experience &lt;/strong&gt;in a high-intensity analytical environment. Backgrounds in I&lt;strong&gt;nvestment Banking, high-growth companies &lt;/strong&gt;or similar are highly valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lqqscq&quot; data-start=&quot;489&quot; data-end=&quot;649&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong FP&amp;amp;A and commercial finance foundation&lt;/strong&gt; with experience supporting business performance through financial modeling, forecasting, and strategic analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
