&lt;li&gt;Partner with UK Product, Commercial, Analytics, and Operations leaders to shape and deliver the international data roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Data and Technology leaders globally to build a consistent, scalable, and internationally aligned data platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the data strategy and execution required to support the launch of new markets and new brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the migration of international data platforms onto shared GCP infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership and sound architectural judgement across data, ML, and platform decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a high-performing, accountable team with clear ownership, strong standards, and sustainable delivery practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience across data engineering, machine learning, data science or platform engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience managing multidisciplinary technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience building, scaling, or leading a modern data platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong technical background, ideally in data engineering, machine learning engineering, or platform engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial and product judgement, with the ability to connect technical investment to business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to prioritise effectively, manage competing demands, and create clarity in ambiguous environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and influencing skills across both technical teams and senior business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
