&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication. &lt;/strong&gt;Clear, specific, opinionated. You say what you decided and why, and you are just as clear on what you chose not to do and why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working in the open. &lt;/strong&gt;You share early and often, and you use critique to sharpen the work. You lift the quality of every review you join.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
