&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Join Zip’s Technology function, responsible for building and maintaining seamless, secure and sustainable platforms that enable our customers to shop with confidence and our merchant partners to grow their brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;As part of our Data and AI Enablement team, you’ll help Zip better understand how work gets done and identify opportunities to make it simpler, more consistent and more effective. You’ll connect business processes with the risks, controls, data and technology that underpin them, creating a clearer view of how our business operates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;As our Business Process Manager, you’ll become a trusted partner to teams across Zip, establishing consistent process modelling practices, strengthening process literacy and exploring how AI and technology can help us rethink the way we work.&lt;/p&gt;
