&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Build a clear view of Zip’s critical business processes, working with functional leaders and Enterprise Risk to validate, assess and prioritise them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Bring existing process information together into a structured, accessible repository that gives teams a reliable source of truth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Map business processes and connect activities with relevant risks, controls, data and systems to create greater visibility across the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Create consistent process workflow models aligned with BPMN 2.0 and Zip’s internal process modelling standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Partner with teams to identify opportunities to redesign processes, remove inefficiencies and improve outcomes for our customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Help evolve Zip’s Process Management Framework, Policy and Modelling Standards, bringing practical insight into how they can work effectively across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Own the administration and ongoing effectiveness of the SAP Signavio process repository and support Process Owners and Process Champions to get the most from our process management capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Support connections between process management and relevant Risk Management, Data Catalogue and Application Catalogue repositories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Use approaches such as Lean, Six Sigma and Kaizen to identify root causes, solve problems and drive meaningful continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Explore how AI and emerging technology can simplify process management, improve self service and create smarter ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Champion new ways of working, helping teams understand and adopt process changes and building greater process literacy across Zip.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring to the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Zipsters work on a broad range of initiatives, and our skills and experiences all look a little different. What really matters to us is that you’re a great fit with our four Values, and have a desire to learn and grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;So whether you meet some or all of the desirable attributes below, we’d still love to hear from you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Extensive experience in business process management, business analysis or a related discipline, with the ability to work across complex organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Strong business process analysis, mapping, design and improvement capability, including impact analysis and performance monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Experience applying BPMN 2.0 and using process modelling platforms, ideally SAP Signavio or a comparable enterprise process management tool.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;A strong understanding of how business process management connects with enterprise architecture, risk management, data and technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Experience applying continuous improvement methodologies such as Lean, Six Sigma or Kaizen to identify root causes and improve business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Strong analytical, problem solving and decision making skills, with an ability to turn complexity into clear and practical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder partnership skills, including the confidence to influence and collaborate with people across different functions and levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Relevant tertiary or industry qualifications, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Project management experience would be valuable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;A mindset that embraces AI and new tools to adapt, learn and grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;An aptitude for identifying and managing risks. Whether you are a People Manager or an Individual Contributor, we are all leaders at Zip, therefore effective risk management is important to how we run our business and part of all our roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Our values in your DNA. Customer First, Own It, Stronger Together and Change the Game.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
