&lt;li&gt;A tertiary qualification, ideally in law, business, finance or a related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Graduate Diploma of Applied Corporate Governance from the Governance Institute of Australia.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of the ASX Listing Rules, Corporations Act 2001 and corporate governance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Diligent Boards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communication skills, with the confidence and judgement to work constructively with Board members and senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisational and prioritisation skills, with the ability to deliver high quality work in a fast paced and deadline driven environment.&lt;/li&gt;
