&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;391&quot; data-end=&quot;598&quot;&gt;Lead the Line 2 Risk Advisory function influencing decisions that support sustainable growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;600&quot; data-end=&quot;755&quot;&gt;Bring deep expertise across Credit, Financial and Enterprise Risk, with a proven track record leading high performing risk teams in regulated financial services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;757&quot; data-end=&quot;837&quot;&gt;Work flexibly in a hybrid model, with team connection days in our Sydney office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1jaf271&quot; data-start=&quot;839&quot; data-end=&quot;883&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;842&quot; data-end=&quot;883&quot;&gt;Write your story with a career at Zip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;885&quot; data-end=&quot;1276&quot;&gt;Join Zip&#39;s Risk &amp;amp; Compliance team, where we partner across the business to enable sustainable growth through strong governance, practical risk management and trusted advice. Working alongside leaders across Australia and New Zealand, our team helps create confidence in decision making by embedding effective risk practices while supporting innovation and delivering great customer outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1278&quot; data-end=&quot;1736&quot;&gt;As Director, Credit &amp;amp; Enterprise Risk Advisory, you&#39;ll lead Zip&#39;s Line 2 Risk Advisory function across Australia and New Zealand, providing independent oversight, challenge and strategic advice across enterprise risk. Reporting to the Chief Risk &amp;amp; Compliance Officer, you&#39;ll lead a team of five experienced risk professionals and play a key leadership role in strengthening Zip&#39;s risk and control environment while enabling the business to grow confidently within risk appetite.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1738&quot; data-end=&quot;1954&quot;&gt;This is a highly visible leadership role where you&#39;ll influence executive decision making, engage regularly with Board and Committee stakeholders and help shape the future maturity of Zip&#39;s Enterprise Risk Framework.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;214ptp&quot; data-start=&quot;1956&quot; data-end=&quot;1978&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1959&quot; data-end=&quot;1978&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1980&quot; data-end=&quot;2117&quot;&gt;Lead the ANZ Line 2 Risk Advisory function, setting strategic direction, priorities and delivering the annual Risk Advisory work program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2119&quot; data-end=&quot;2309&quot;&gt;Partner with Executive Leadership and senior business leaders to embed effective risk management into strategic planning, operational decision making and business transformation initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2311&quot; data-end=&quot;2450&quot;&gt;Provide independent challenge and commercially balanced advice on material risks, emerging issues, risk appetite and control effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2452&quot; data-end=&quot;2626&quot;&gt;Lead oversight of Credit and Financial Risk, including portfolio performance, underwriting, credit decisioning, model governance, stress testing and financial risk exposures.&lt;/li&gt;
