&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience leading large scale engineering organisations across payments, merchant platforms or digital commerce, with expertise in modern payments architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the future of payments and AI powered commerce, leading the technology strategy behind one of Zip&#39;s most critical platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working with team connection days in our Sydney or Melbourne offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Write your story with a career at Zip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;832&quot; data-end=&quot;1037&quot;&gt;Join Zip&#39;s Technology function, responsible for building and maintaining seamless, secure and sustainable platforms that enable customers to shop with confidence and merchant partners to grow their brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1039&quot; data-end=&quot;1619&quot;&gt;As Director, Engineering for our Merchant &amp;amp; Payments domain, you will lead the technology strategy that powers how merchants discover, integrate, accept payments and grow with Zip.&amp;nbsp;Working alongside Product, Design and Architecture leaders, you&#39;ll shape the next generation of intelligent commerce experiences by combining modern payment infrastructure, scalable platform engineering and AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1039&quot; data-end=&quot;1619&quot;&gt;This is a rare opportunity to influence the future of commerce while leading high performing engineering teams delivering platforms that are trusted by millions of customers and merchants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute the engineering strategy for Zip&#39;s Merchant &amp;amp; Payments domain, aligning technology investment with our long term business strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the evolution of our merchant and payments platforms across onboarding, orchestration, trust, settlement and merchant enablement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product, Design and Architecture leaders to deliver seamless merchant experiences from acquisition through to ongoing growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the future of AI enabled and Agentic Commerce by identifying opportunities to apply emerging technologies to customer and merchant experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, mentor and inspire high performing engineering leaders, creating a culture of innovation, accountability and engineering excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive modern engineering practices, sustainable delivery models and operational excellence across multiple engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership across cloud native platforms and distributed systems while balancing innovation with resilience, security and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence executive stakeholders and external partners to help shape the future of payments and digital commerce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion continuous improvement through experimentation, learning and technology innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;4039&quot; data-end=&quot;4257&quot;&gt;Zipsters work on a broad range of initiatives, and our skills and experiences all look a little different. What really matters to us is that you&#39;re a great fit with our four Values, and have a desire to learn and grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4259&quot; data-end=&quot;4359&quot;&gt;So whether you meet some or all of the desirable attributes below, we&#39;d still love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive leadership experience building and scaling engineering organisations within fintech, payments, digital commerce or marketplace businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise across modern payments architecture, including payment orchestration, tokenisation, acquiring, fraud, trust, clearing and settlement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining technology strategy that balances long term platform evolution with commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of cloud native architectures and distributed systems, with experience guiding engineering organisations at enterprise scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience applying AI to improve customer experiences, merchant capabilities or engineering productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success leading Engineering Managers and senior technology leaders while building inclusive, high performing cultures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen with the ability to influence executive stakeholders across Technology, Product and the broader business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with modern engineering technologies such as AWS, Kubernetes and microservices architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for innovation, continuous improvement and building engineering teams that thrive through change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A mindset that embraces AI and new tools to adapt, learn and grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An aptitude for identifying and managing risks. Whether you are a People Manager or an Individual Contributor, we are all leaders at Zip, therefore effective risk management is important to how we run our business and part of all our roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our values in your DNA: Customer First, Own It, Stronger Together and Change the Game&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we write this next exciting chapter in our story, we will continue to move at pace and embrace change. For you, this might mean opportunities to learn new skills with hands-on experience, broader responsibilities, or the buzz of seeing your work impact customers faster.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zip is a place where you’ll get out exactly what you put in. When you join the team, we&#39;ll do our best to make sure you can be yourself and surround yourself with smart, friendly colleagues and leaders who have your back, so that you can make the big things happen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zipsters tell us these are just some of the best things about working here. You’ll also receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days paid leave annually, including birthday leave and quarterly wellbeing days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;16 weeks paid parental leave for primary carers, and 4 weeks for supporting carers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family support policies including miscarriage bereavement leave and domestic violence leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and wellness initiatives, including $299 annual wellbeing allowance, free access for you and family members to our EAP service Sonder, discounted private health insurance, and great rates on fitness sessions through ClassPass&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 days paid volunteering leave per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the Flare Benefits Hub and Novated Leasing for savings across lifestyle, essentials and wellbeing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fee-free Zip products, and discounts with Zip merchant partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team social events, epic offices, free breakfast daily, and weekly free lunches&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a part of a team that reflects the diversity of our customers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We pride ourselves on being a workplace that provides equal opportunities to people of all ages, cultural backgrounds, sexual orientations, gender identities, abilities, veteran status, and everything else that makes you unique.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Equally, we’re committed to ensuring our recruitment processes are accessible and inclusive. Please let us know If there are any adjustments that need to be made to ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And finally…get to know us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zip Co Limited (ASX: ZIP) is a digital financial services company, offering innovative, people-centred products that bring customers and merchants together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operating in two core markets - Australia and New Zealand (ANZ) and the US, Zip offers point-of-sale credit and digital payment services, connecting millions of customers with its global network of tens of thousands of merchants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud to be a values-led business and our values - Customer First, Own it, Stronger Together and Change the Game - guide us in everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;

f1c96ba7-e500-58fe-badb-30c7b71f0ff5.original_description:
&lt;div class=&quot;jdp-v1-container-fluid jdp-v1-data-buckets&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;jdp-v1-row-fluid&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Lead the strategy for Growth &amp;amp; Customer Analytics, helping determine where, when, and how Zip invests to drive customer acquisition, engagement, retention, pricing, and long-term commercial growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Build and scale a high-performing analytics organization that transforms customer and marketing data into business decisions through close partnership with Customer, Product, Finance, Data Science, and Data Engineering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Champion AI-enabled customer intelligence by translating predictive analytics, customer insights, and next-best-action capabilities into measurable business outcomes rather than simply analytical outputs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Remote-first opportunity for US-based employees with the option to work in-person out of our Manhattan office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start your adventure with Zip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Zip is entering its next phase of growth as we expand from a single-product business to a multi-product platform. As marketing investment accelerates, we&#39;re looking for a Director of Growth &amp;amp; Customer Analytics to help determine where, when, and how we invest to drive customer growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This leader will own the customer organization&#39;s analytics strategy and serve as the primary strategic partner connecting Customer leadership with centralized Data Science and Data Engineering teams. Success in this role means translating customer, marketing, pricing, and lifecycle analytics into decisions that improve acquisition, engagement, retention, and commercial performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interesting Problems You&#39;ll Get to Solve&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own the Growth &amp;amp; Customer Analytics strategy, operating model, and roadmap, partnering with Customer leadership to define priorities, marketing investment strategy, and measurable business outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Serve as the strategic analytics partner to Customer leadership, translating customer behavior, marketing effectiveness, pricing, lifecycle economics, and commercial performance into clear business recommendations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Lead and develop a high-performing analytics team responsible for customer acquisition, lifecycle analytics, pricing, customer experience, partnerships, and commercial insights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with centralized Data Science and Data Engineering teams to prioritize business requirements, influence technical roadmaps, and ensure analytical capabilities are operationalized across the organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Improve the accessibility, quality, and speed of customer insights by optimizing measurement, experimentation, attribution, pricing analytics, customer segmentation, and insight activation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This role is ultimately about helping Zip make better customer and marketing investment decisions. The Director will use analytics to shape business strategy while partnering with centralized technical teams to deliver the capabilities that make those decisions possible.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Projects You’ll Own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with Data Engineering to define the business vision, requirements, and priorities for a real-time customer data layer that enables better customer, marketing, pricing, and lifecycle decisions across the organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with Data Science to define business requirements, prioritize use cases, and operationalize analytical capabilities including:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Predictive models that go beyond behavioral pattern recognition to model customer intent. We aim to understand and action on why customers do what they do, not just what they do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A Next-best-action framework that translates model outputs into specific recommended actions for AI agents, the product, and human-facing teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Marketing Mix Modeling and multi-touch attribution capabilities that give the customer org a reliable, up-to-date view of acquisition channel effectiveness, translating model outputs into investment recommendations that optimize budget allocation across paid, owned, and partner channels&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with Data Engineering to establish reliable, accurate affiliate revenue reporting as a foundational data capability, defining the business requirements, validating the output, and ensuring the customer org has consistent commercial visibility into affiliate-influenced acquisition and revenue&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own the business strategy and requirements for building a clear, connected view of B2B marketing performance, spanning web analytics, account and engagement scoring, building attribution models, and pipeline influence, creating clear reporting of where B2B investment is driving commercial outcomes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring to the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;10+ years of experience in customer analytics, marketing analytics, business intelligence, data science, or a related quantitative discipline, including 5+ years leading high-performing analytics or data teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Proven experience building and executing enterprise data and analytics strategies that drive measurable business outcomes across customer acquisition, lifecycle management, pricing, and commercial performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Deep expertise in customer analytics including experimentation, attribution, marketing mix modeling, customer segmentation, forecasting, pricing analytics, and lifecycle measurement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience partnering closely with Data Science and Data Engineering organizations to define business requirements, influence technical roadmaps, and deliver scalable data products and analytical capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated success translating complex analytical concepts into clear recommendations that influence executive decision-making and cross-functional strategy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of modern data ecosystems, customer data platforms, data governance, and real-time data architectures, with experience improving the accessibility, quality, and reliability of enterprise data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience leading analytics initiatives that span multiple business functions, balancing competing priorities while aligning stakeholders around shared customer and commercial outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong commercial acumen with experience using data to optimize marketing investment, customer growth, retention, pricing strategies, and revenue performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience leading, coaching, and developing high-performing analytical teams while fostering a culture of curiosity, accountability, and continuous improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience defining and leveraging AI-driven customer intelligence capabilities. You understand how predictive models, customer intent modeling, recommendation engines, and AI-powered decision frameworks can improve customer experiences and business performance. You have successfully partnered with technical teams to operationalize AI solutions into business workflows and are comfortable leading organizations through AI-enabled transformation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Analytics, Statistics, Economics, Computer Science, Mathematics, Engineering, or a related quantitative field. An advanced degree (MBA, MS, or PhD) is preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Get in Return&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Zip is a place where you&#39;ll get out what you put in. The newness of our sector means we need to move at pace and embrace change, and our promise to you when you join the team is that you&#39;ll feel empowered and trusted to make big things happen quickly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We want you to feel welcome and as though you have the support to be yourself, and care for yourself at work. Because it&#39;s important to us that you make the most of the opportunities you&#39;ll get to grow your skills and your career, and be surrounded by smart, friendly people and leaders that have your back.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We think these are some of the best things about being a Zipster. We will also offer you:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Flexible working culture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Incentive programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Unlimited PTO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Generous paid parental leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Leading family support policies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Company-sponsored 401(k) match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Learning and wellness subscription stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Beautiful Union Square office with a casual dress code&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Industry-leading, employer-sponsored insurance for you and your dependents, with several 100% Zip-covered choices available&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Zip is committed to a straightforward and transparent pay structure. The actual base salary will be determined by various individualized factors, including job-related knowledge, skills, experience, location, internal equity, as well as other objective business considerations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The annual base Pay Range for this position is $199,000 - $240,000. This range reflects our US national compensation band (USN). Additional premium percentages may apply based on our tiered premium strategy.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Subject to those same considerations, the total compensation package for this position may also include other elements, including a &lt;strong&gt;25% STI opportunity and equity awards&lt;/strong&gt;, in addition to a full range of medical, financial, and other benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;If hired, employees will be in an &quot;at-will&quot; position and the Company reserves the right to modify base salary (as well as any other discretionary payment or compensation or benefit program) at any time, including for reasons related to individual performance, Company or individual department/team performance, and market factors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a Part of a Team That Reflects the Diversity of Our Customers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We pride ourselves on being a workplace that provides equal opportunities to people of all ages, cultural backgrounds, sexual orientations, gender identities, abilities, veteran status, and everything else that makes you unique.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Equally, we&#39;re committed to ensuring our recruitment processes are accessible and inclusive. Please let us know if there are any adjustments that need to be made to ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And Finally...Get to Know Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Zip Co Limited (ASX: ZIP) is a digital financial services company, offering innovative, people-centered products.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Operating in two core markets—Australia and New Zealand (ANZ) and the US—Zip offers access to point-of-sale credit and digital payment services, connecting millions of customers with its global network of tens of thousands of merchants.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re proud to be a values-led business and our values—&lt;strong&gt;Customer First, Own It, Stronger Together, and Change the Game&lt;/strong&gt;—guide us in everything we do.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;I acknowledge by clicking &quot;Submit Application&quot; that the information provided is true and correct. I also understand that any willful dishonesty may render refusal of this application or immediate termination of employment. By providing your information, you acknowledge that you have read our Zip Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice and authorize Zip to process your data subject to those terms. Zip participates in the federal government&#39;s E-Verify program.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Before you apply, give Zip a try → rebrand.ly/check-zip-out&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

