&lt;li&gt;Define and execute the product strategy and roadmap across the Customer Engagement &amp;amp; Digital Foundations domain, ensuring alignment with customer needs, business priorities and long-term product strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead product discovery, validation and delivery, balancing customer value, commercial outcomes and technical feasibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Engineering and Design teams to deliver secure, scalable and intuitive customer experiences across web, mobile and digital platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to embed AI-enabled capabilities that improve customer engagement, increase automated self-service and create more personalised customer experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use customer insights, analytics, experimentation and market research to identify opportunities, validate hypotheses and inform product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define success measures and monitor product performance, using data to continuously optimise customer, operational and commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage product risk, ensuring appropriate governance, controls and compliance are embedded throughout the product lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across Product, Engineering and Design to build reusable digital capabilities that strengthen Zip&#39;s digital foundations and accelerate product delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion a culture of experimentation, continuous improvement and customer-centred product development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships across the business, aligning stakeholders around a shared product vision while influencing outcomes across multiple teams.&lt;/li&gt;
