&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering closely with Engineering and Design teams to deliver exceptional customer experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical capability with experience using customer insights, experimentation and data to drive product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing complex stakeholder relationships and influencing outcomes across cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and practical experience exploring emerging technologies, including AI-enabled products, automation, agentic experiences and new digital commerce models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of agile product management, experimentation and customer-centred product development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and relationship-building skills, with the ability to influence stakeholders and build alignment around a shared product vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A mindset that embraces AI and new tools to adapt, learn and grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An aptitude for identifying and managing risks. Whether you are a People Manager or an Individual Contributor, we are all leaders at Zip, therefore effective risk management is important to how we run our business and part of all our roles.&lt;/li&gt;
