&lt;p&gt;Zip prides itself on being a workplace that provides equal opportunities to people of all ages, cultural backgrounds, sexual orientations, gender identities, abilities, veteran status, and everything else that makes you unique.&amp;nbsp;Equally, Zip is committed to ensuring its recruitment processes are accessible and inclusive. Please let Zip know if there are any adjustments that need to be made to ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
