2b6bc6e3-a242-5896-854d-392a17ab5bc5.original_description:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unlock Your Future: Express Your Interest Today and Be First In Line For Upcoming Opportunities! &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Welcome to a unique opportunity to elevate your career with Sora Union, where we are actively seeking individuals with diverse expertise in Engineering, Design, QA. If you are passionate about making a meaningful impact in a fully remote environment characterized by a rich tapestry of cultures, then you&#39;ve come to the right place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Choose Sora Staffing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellence&lt;/strong&gt; - We strive for excellence in everything we do. This relates to client deliverables, but also how we interact with each other, how we continue to grow and improve daily to be the best version of ourselves for clients, but also for each other.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empathy &amp;amp; Inclusivity&lt;/strong&gt; - We embrace and protect one of our most special assets at Sora Union: the diversity and resilience of our teammates. Empathy is how we treat each other and how we put ourselves in each others&#39; shoes, and support each other. Inclusivity is getting the most out of different perspectives, both respecting but also celebrating and valuing our unique backgrounds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partnership&lt;/strong&gt; - We work together to deliver excellence for our clients and each other. We are owners of our own work, but collective owners of our teams’ work. We learn from each other by communicating, being accessible and collectively working towards the best outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability&lt;/strong&gt; - As a startup there are a lot of moving parts: new and evolving processes. We are agile in our ability and speed at which we adapt to change while continuing to serve clients and support each other.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote Work Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Join a team that has mastered the art of remote collaboration. Enjoy the flexibility and autonomy that comes with working from anywhere in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; We believe in investing in our people. Your professional development is as important to us as it is to you, and we provide avenues for continuous learning and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovative Projects:&lt;/strong&gt; Be part of projects that push the boundaries of innovation. Your skills will be put to the test as we tackle challenges and explore new frontiers together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are ready to be a part of a team that values excellence, embraces adaptability, thrives on partnership, leads with empathy, and celebrates inclusivity, we invite you to apply!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

